target_stage: DONE_ENGINEERING
depends_on: [PERF-070, MASTER-GSTUDIO, VIZ-090]
goal: Реализовать versioned deterministic Studio-scale performance gate для Local-first Analytics Studio: lazy widget execution, bounded concurrency, cancellation/stale-result discard, semantic-safe downsampling/virtualization и render/query budgets на synthetic 20k/50k без изменения FIN-TRUTH.
non_goals:
  - Не добавлять новые analytics families, KPI formulas или renderer business logic.
  - Не менять FIN-TRUTH, canonical transaction semantics, storage ownership или product write authority.
  - Не вводить paid/external performance SaaS, CDN или обязательный network provider.
  - Не публиковать реальные/real-derived финансовые значения, labels/IDs или private runtime locators в GitHub evidence.
  - Не считать wall-clock GitHub runner timings пользовательским SLA.
data_touched: independently generated synthetic analytics/dashboard configurations and technical timing/count/hash metadata only
privacy_class: public-safe synthetic-only evidence; private runtime payload remains runtime-only
cost_class: FREE_ONLY
acceptance:
  - versioned PERF-090 contract задаёт bounded Studio workload profile, render/query budgets, hidden/offscreen widget policy, cancellation/generation semantics и technical evidence schema;
  - hidden/offscreen widgets не выполняют лишние analytics queries и не создают render work до явной активации;
  - visible widgets исполняются с bounded concurrency; identical eligible queries reuse/coalesce PERF-070 planner/cache path;
  - stale completion после newer generation/filter/revision explicit DISCARDED_STALE и не commit-ится в current render state;
  - semantic-safe virtualization/downsampling разрешены только как presentation optimization и не меняют canonical AnalyticsResult/query hash/FIN totals;
  - high-density views имеют deterministic bounded fallback/accessible representation вместо unbounded DOM/render workload;
  - seeded synthetic 20k/50k Studio benchmark доказывает zero financial writes, bounded query/render counts и generous non-SLA CI ceilings;
  - hidden widgets produce zero extra query load; repeated warm same-revision views reuse approved cache path;
  - public telemetry/evidence содержит только schema/version/profile/widget-count/query-count/render-count/cache/coalesce/discard/status/reason/hash-prefix/timing metadata;
  - existing PERF-070, STUDIO-REC, VIZ-090, analytics/FIN/privacy/FREE_ONLY/full layered/UI/PWA gates remain green;
  - Trusted exact-head deploy/runtime health, autonomous merge и Main Verification PASS до DONE_ENGINEERING.
evidence_required:
  - PERF-090 contract/property tests PASS;
  - hidden/offscreen zero-query-load PASS;
  - bounded concurrency + stale cancellation PASS;
  - synthetic 20k/50k Studio-scale budget PASS;
  - FIN/query identity/downsampling invariance PASS;
  - privacy/FREE_ONLY/full native + ADWF consumer gates PASS;
  - trusted-dev-deploy + trusted-runtime-health + autonomous merge + Main Verification PASS.
rollback: Revert PERF-090 contracts/runtime coordinator/tests/docs/gate; PERF-070 planner/cache, Studio and VIZ-090 remain authoritative fallback without Studio-scale optimization gate.
observability: technical schema/version/profile/hash prefixes/widget/query/render/cache/coalesce/discard counts/status/reason/timing only; no financial payload/private IDs
